The CiteBase project authors dedicate the original fictional phase2 corpus,
questions, reference answers, evidence annotations, and security fixtures to
the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, to the extent permitted by law.

This dedication covers documents/, extracted/, evaluation.json, dev.json,
test.json, security.json, and their manifest. It does not change the licenses
of Java, PDFBox, or other tools used to generate and inspect these files.

All organizations, operational thresholds, and scenarios in this corpus are
fictional test data. They are not medical, environmental, or safety advice.

